7-Day Social Media Promotional Campaign

1. Campaign Overview

Campaign Name: Codomax Internship Awareness Campaign

Objective: Promote Codomax internship opportunities among college students and fresh graduates through Instagram, LinkedIn and student communities.

Target Audience:

BCA and MCA students

B.Sc. and engineering students

College students

Fresh graduates

Students interested in technology and digital skills

Official Internship Link: https://codomaxdigital.in/internship

Campaign Duration: 7 Days

2. Seven-Day Campaign Plan

Day 1 – Internship Awareness

Platform: Instagram and LinkedIn

Topic: Why internships are important for college students.

Hook: "Studying in college but still worried about practical experience?"

Content: Introduce Codomax internship opportunities and explain how internships help students develop practical skills.

CTA: Explore internship opportunities.

KPI Target: 300 reach, 15 engagements and 10 link clicks.

Day 2 – Data Science Internship

Platform: Instagram

Topic: Promote the Data Science domain.

Hook: "Interested in Python, data and analytics?"

Content: Highlight opportunities to explore data-related concepts and improve technical knowledge.

CTA: Explore the available internship domains.

KPI Target: 250 reach, 10 engagements and 10 link clicks.

Day 3 – Web Development and Full Stack Development

Platform: Instagram and LinkedIn

Topic: Promote Web Development and Full Stack Development.

Hook: "Want to turn your coding knowledge into practical skills?"

Content: Explain how students can strengthen their development knowledge through learning and project-based activities.

CTA: Visit the official internship page.

KPI Target: 300 reach, 15 engagements and 10 link clicks.

Day 4 – Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning

Platform: Instagram

Topic: Introduce AI and Machine Learning opportunities.

Hook: "Curious about the future of Artificial Intelligence?"

Content: Highlight AI and ML as growing technology fields and encourage students to explore these domains.

CTA: Discover the internship program.

KPI Target: 250 reach, 15 engagements and 10 link clicks.

Day 5 – Career Benefits and Certificates

Platform: Instagram and LinkedIn

Topic: Learning opportunities, practical experience and certificates.

Hook: "Build your skills. Gain experience. Strengthen your portfolio."

Content: Highlight skill development, practical learning and certificates after successful internship completion. Mention applicable certificate terms accurately.

CTA: Check program details and eligibility.

KPI Target: 300 reach, 15 engagements and 10 link clicks.

Day 6 – Student Opportunity Spotlight

Platform: LinkedIn and Student Communities

Topic: Share internship opportunities with college students.

Hook: "Looking for an online internship opportunity?"

Content: Share information about available domains, intended audience and how to apply.

CTA: Explore and apply through the official website.

KPI Target: 300 reach, 20 engagements and 15 link clicks.

Day 7 – Final Internship Promotion

Platform: Instagram, LinkedIn and Student Communities

Topic: Final campaign promotion.

Hook: "Your next learning opportunity could start today!"

Content: Summarize the available internship domains, learning benefits and registration information.

CTA: Visit the official Codomax internship page.

KPI Target: 400 reach, 25 engagements and 20 link clicks.

3. Key Performance Indicators (KPIs)

The following metrics will be used to evaluate the campaign:

Reach: Number of unique users who see the content.

Impressions: Total number of times content is displayed.

Engagement: Likes, comments, shares and saves.

Link Clicks: Number of users visiting the internship page.

Profile Visits: Number of users visiting the social media profile.

Conversions: Number of users completing the registration process.

4. Content Strategy

Use attractive and simple promotional designs.

Write short, student-friendly captions.

Include relevant hashtags.

Use clear calls to action.

Share useful educational information along with promotional content.

Maintain consistent branding across platforms.

5. Campaign Conclusion

This seven-day promotional campaign is designed to increase awareness of Codomax internship opportunities among college students and fresh graduates.

By using Instagram, LinkedIn and student communities, the campaign aims to improve engagement, generate internship page visits and encourage interested students to explore the available opportunities.

Official Website: https://codomaxdigital.in/internship

Note: All KPI figures are proposed targets, not actual campaign results. Actual performance should be recorded after publishing.
